# Canonical author identities for this repository.
#
# Git resolves a commit's recorded address through this file whenever it
# displays authorship, so `git log`, `git shortlog` and `git blame` show
# the institutional address even for commits that recorded another one.
# It changes what is displayed, not what is stored: the commits are
# untouched. `main` is a protected branch on baltig, which refuses the
# force-push a rewrite would need, so this is the only way to correct
# authorship here after a push.
#
# Format:  Proper Name <proper@address> <address recorded in the commit>

Alessandro Savino <alessandro.savino@polito.it> <notinmyhead@gmail.com>
